  "steps": [
    "Fry the chopped onion with the sliced mushrooms.",
    "Add the soy cream, parsley, salt and pepper. Set the filling aside.",
    "Trim the root and the dark top of the leeks and blanch them briefly in boiling water.",
    "Cut them lengthwise and separate the large layers.",
    "Lay two leek strips in a cross and put some filling in the centre.",
    "Fold the strips over the filling to close it like a ravioli.",
    "Brown the parcels in a pan with a little Emmental on top.",
    "Cover for a few minutes to melt the cheese."
